.TH CW "1" "October 2026" "cw 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cw \- cw go
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cw
\fI\,go \/\fR[\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR] \fI\,TARGET\/\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IP
Jump to a Context window (bring it to front).
.IP
A number jumps by ref from `cw windows \fB\-\-all\fR`. A name jumps by Context.
.IP
Examples:
.TP
cw go MyProject
last used window in Context
.TP
cw go MyProject/Development
specific window
.TP
cw go \-
jump back to previous Context
.TP
cw go 3
window #3 from `cw windows \fB\-\-all\fR`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show this message and exit.
